Third-party material
--------------------

Dependencies keep their own licenses (go.mod / go.sum, web/package.json and
web/pnpm-lock.yaml). The following data is bundled in this repository, and the
first four are embedded in the xila-api binary:

- SPDX License List data (internal/license/data/catalog.json),
  https://github.com/spdx/license-list-data, CC0-1.0.

- ScanCode LicenseDB license categories (internal/license/data/catalog.json),
  https://scancode-licensedb.aboutcode.org, Copyright (c) nexB Inc. and
  others, licensed CC-BY-4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
  The data was reduced to license keys and their categories.

- choosealicense.com license terms (internal/license/data/catalog.json),
  https://github.com/github/choosealicense.com, Copyright (c) 2013-2026
  GitHub, Inc. and contributors, licensed MIT. The data was reduced to each
  license's permissions, conditions and limitations.

- CycloneDX JSON schemas, specification versions 1.2 through 1.7, plus the
  spdx, jsf-0.82 and cryptography-defs schemas they reference
  (internal/sbom/schema/cyclonedx), embedded in the xila-api binary for
  strict SBOM upload validation (M12 12.14):
  https://github.com/CycloneDX/specification, Apache-2.0.

- Sample reports used by `xila-api demo-seed` (internal/demo/testdata):
  licenses-maven.cdx.json from the CycloneDX bom-examples
  (https://github.com/CycloneDX/bom-examples), Apache-2.0; semgrep.json from the
  DefectDojo unit-test scans
  (https://github.com/DefectDojo/django-DefectDojo), BSD-3-Clause.

- Test fixtures under internal/*/testdata, used only by the test suite. Their
  sources and licenses (among others DefectDojo and SecObserve, BSD-3-Clause;
  CycloneDX bom-examples and specification examples, Apache-2.0; Red Hat CSAF
  VEX, CC BY 4.0; steampipe-security-controls-module, MIT) are recorded next to
  the tests that read them.

- Compliance frameworks (internal/database/migrations): control identifiers and
  short paraphrased titles only; the standards' texts (ISO/IEC 27001, PCI DSS,
  AICPA TSC, OWASP ASVS, NIS2, EU CRA) are not reproduced.
